message: "If you use this deposit, please cite it as below."
type: software
abstract: >
  This deposit contains code and data for the paper "Reproducibility and Open Science in Economics", published in Revue Economique.
  The code is in R and constructs most tables and figures from outside data sources.
  All data are public and redistributable, with derivative data available under a CC-BY-NC-4.0 license unless otherwise noted.
